---
const testimonials = [
  {
    content: "Code-QX me ha proporcionado un sistema bastante completo, realmente cumple con optimizar los procesos de mi negocio a un precio realmente razonable",
    author: "Henry Mendez",
    position: "Dueño de Tejedora MZ TIPICOS S.A.",
    company: "MZ TIPICOS S.A.",
    avatar: "public/imagenes/sinFoto.jpeg"
  },
  {
    content: "Estoy muy satisfecha con el servicio de Code-QX. El sistema es completo, fácil de usar y ha sido de gran ayuda para mejorar y agilizar los proceso de mi negocio. Además, la atención fue excelente y el precio muy razonable. ",
    author: "Ashlee Ying Tse Castellanos",
    position: "Dueña de Aroma",
    company: "AROMA S.A.",
    avatar: "public/imagenes/sinFoto.jpeg"
  },
  {
    content: "Muy satisfechos con el resultado, la página que diseñaron permitirá tener mucho más alcance, y darnos a conocer por todo el país y lo que hacemos para mejorar la educación.",
    author: "Samuel Vásquez",
    position: "Director",
    company: "Fundación Transformando Vidas",
    avatar: "public/imagenes/sinFoto.jpeg"
  }
];
---

<section id="testimonials" class="section">
  <div class="container-custom">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary-100 dark:bg-secondary-900 text-secondary-600 dark:text-secondary-300 font-medium text-sm mb-4">
        opiniones
      </span>
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2>
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="h-px w-8 bg-green-700/30"></span>
        <span class="testimonial-diamond bg-green-800"></span>
        <span class="testimonial-diamond scale-75 bg-accent-500"></span>
        <span class="testimonial-diamond bg-green-500"></span>
        <span class="h-px w-8 bg-green-700/30"></span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        No se fíe solo de nuestras palabras. Esto es lo que nuestros clientes hablan sobre la experiencia que han tenido con nuestros servicios.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      {testimonials.map((testimonial, index) => (
        <div 
          class="testimonial-card card relative p-6 border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 slide-up" 
          style={`animation-delay: ${index * 150}ms`}
        >
          <div class="testimonial-corner absolute right-0 top-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>

          <svg class="mb-4 h-8 w-8 text-green-700/70 dark:text-green-400/70" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M13.2 7.1C7.5 9.2 4.1 13.5 4.1 19c0 3.8 2.3 6.2 5.6 6.2 3 0 5.1-2.1 5.1-5 0-2.7-1.8-4.5-4.3-4.8.5-2.5 2.3-4.5 5.2-6L13.2 7.1Zm13 0C20.5 9.2 17.1 13.5 17.1 19c0 3.8 2.3 6.2 5.6 6.2 3 0 5.1-2.1 5.1-5 0-2.7-1.8-4.5-4.3-4.8.5-2.5 2.3-4.5 5.2-6l-2.5-2.3Z" />
          </svg>

          <blockquote class="relative z-10 mb-6 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 italic">"{testimonial.content}"</blockquote>

          <div class="mb-5 flex items-center gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="h-px flex-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-700/25 to-transparent"></span>
            <span class="testimonial-diamond scale-75 bg-green-700"></span>
            <span class="testimonial-diamond scale-50 bg-accent-500"></span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center">
            <img 
              src={testimonial.avatar} 
              alt={testimonial.author} 
              class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full mr-4 object-cover ring-2 ring-green-700/15 ring-offset-2 ring-offset-white dark:ring-green-400/20 dark:ring-offset-secondary-900"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">{testimonial.author}</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">{testimonial.position}, {testimonial.company}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    
    <div class="business-cta mt-16 relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-green-300/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-green-950 via-green-900 to-green-700 p-8 shadow-xl shadow-green-950/15 md:p-12">
      <div class="cta-texture absolute inset-0 opacity-20" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-20 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-accent-400/15 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-20 left-1/3 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-green-400/15 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="cta-corner absolute right-5 top-5 hidden opacity-60 sm:flex" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 text-center md:flex md:items-center md:justify-between md:text-left">
        <div class="mb-7 md:mb-0 md:mr-10">
          <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 md:justify-start" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="h-px w-8 bg-accent-400/70"></span>
            <span class="testimonial-diamond bg-accent-400"></span>
            <span class="testimonial-diamond scale-75 bg-green-300"></span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white md:text-3xl">¿Listo para transformar tu negocio?</h3>
          <p class="max-w-2xl text-green-50/80">Únase a los cientos de clientes satisfechos que han mejorado su manera de trabajar con nuestros servicios profesionales.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="#signup" class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-green-950 shadow-lg shadow-green-950/20 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-accent-300 hover:shadow-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent-300 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-green-900">
          Comience ahora
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ml-2 h-5 w-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10.293 5.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l4 4a1 1 0 010 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L12.586 11H5a1 1 0 110-2h7.586l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonial-card {
    transition: transform 300ms ease, box-shadow 300ms ease, border-color 300ms ease;
  }

  .testimonial-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: rgba(47, 171, 46, 0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px -24px rgba(3, 77, 8, 0.45);
  }

  .testimonial-diamond {
    display: block;
    width: 0.6rem;
    height: 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 0.1rem;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .testimonial-corner {
    width: 4.5rem;
    height: 4.5rem;
    opacity: 0.13;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(135deg, #034d08 25%, transparent 25%),
      linear-gradient(225deg, #2fab2e 25%, transparent 25%),
      linear-gradient(45deg, #d9e11a 25%, transparent 25%);
    background-position: 18px 0, 18px 0, 0 18px;
    background-size: 36px 36px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(225deg, black, transparent 72%);
  }

  .cta-texture {
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px),
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(217, 225, 26, 0.08) 0, rgba(217, 225, 26, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 10px);
    mask-image: linear-gradient(90deg, black, transparent 82%);
  }

  .cta-corner {
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .cta-corner span {
    display: block;
    width: 0.75rem;
    height: 0.75rem;
    border: 2px solid #86efac;
    border-radius: 0.1rem;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .cta-corner span:nth-child(2) {
    background: #d9e11a;
    border-color: #d9e11a;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .testimonial-card,
    .testimonial-card:hover {
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }

    .business-cta a,
    .business-cta a:hover {
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
